{
 "batchId": "b-0063",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_3367342e04b256c84511",
   "sourceHash": "3367342e04b256c84511f1aad933f6ec155c84480b9d81de05d00f4aaeaebd4e",
   "text": "本方案是否适合肠易激综合征（IBS）或其他消化问题？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_766b7c7a3b5a1324e40f",
   "sourceHash": "766b7c7a3b5a1324e40fd605e9cb11a5fb87fd4b6a1bd1b2714b0bf6cffd6e49",
   "text": "请向医生提供您的诊断、症状及目前的治疗情况，以便评估本方案是否适合您。如有新出现、持续或加重的消化道症状，应在选择本方案前先接受医学评估。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ae02271cd6cfa985f0b",
   "sourceHash": "6ae02271cd6cfa985f0bb78d025476d5d68f1b3d4bd26345d6712e41d8c24a8a",
   "text": "入院前我应提供哪些信息？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9de5768924fb2feaa381",
   "sourceHash": "9de5768924fb2feaa38186b6b0914ef6267067cd540dfbf2687da5ed17c679fb",
   "text": "请提供您的病史、目前症状和治疗目标，包括是否确诊肠易激综合征（IBS）或炎症性肠病、近期是否接受过腹部手术，以及是否存在原因不明的消化道症状。这将有助于医生评估本方案是否适合您。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6968c02e6c32a352aefb",
   "sourceHash": "6968c02e6c32a352aefb9f531afe45814306bb7e7a20be8713c47079efe861ff",
   "text": "消化健康与肠道健康瑜伽疗法 Agni Dipanam Yoga Chikitsa（奇基察）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit programme name kept in Latin form; approved term Chikitsa（奇基察）applied."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_484ac11a6de2b35cc2b0",
   "sourceHash": "484ac11a6de2b35cc2b0e80c039fdad8145701b4438bab09e0aa59ca11413e85",
   "text": "Kairali肠道健康瑜伽疗法——以阿育吠陀调理消化",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bd620d5223fea6896d1f",
   "sourceHash": "bd620d5223fea6896d1f1cefc19c888e80b30037eddef26b17685a109153f973",
   "text": "一位患者在Kairali明亮的瑜伽室内，于垫上练习辅助弓步瑜伽动作",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8af9885d25c72c3b010a",
   "sourceHash": "8af9885d25c72c3b010adcc0e2cc1e85297793fed4f7858680692176c965b960",
   "text": "一位患者在Kairali的瑜伽课上跪姿、双掌举过头顶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dc24a1448e8dfe73e29f",
   "sourceHash": "dc24a1448e8dfe73e29f8004bf216dde6cbf21545713b59465e535585049a252",
   "text": "一位患者在Kairali的瑜伽课上盘腿静坐冥想",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ea4f3b5adeae886efc72",
   "sourceHash": "ea4f3b5adeae886efc72f6c8136b19174961779af03382fc7e478fcefb44240e",
   "text": "一位患者在Kairali灯光温暖的瑜伽室内跪姿、双掌举过头顶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3fe39c1e87b74fc17269",
   "sourceHash": "3fe39c1e87b74fc1726909555d8c23f868da011c0a075ec0dbe38702323b1d60",
   "text": "观看疗愈村的瑜伽影片——将在新标签页中打开YouTube",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1836a6b7d88d78260ec",
   "sourceHash": "c1836a6b7d88d78260ec4672e8f40efa5dac62e1d07e1efc25e7bde8c4371a24",
   "text": "在Kairali明亮的瑜伽室内练习瑜伽",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5ce753473a47887eb61d",
   "sourceHash": "5ce753473a47887eb61dc30bb34a63aab858237e260dda4272f9abff14c61473",
   "text": "我们首先会进行全面的问诊，了解您的病史、症状和生活方式。这有助于我们判断您独特的dosha（体能）失衡情况，并制定个性化的治疗计划。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d587eaca13c50eb01470",
   "sourceHash": "d587eaca13c50eb014708cfcb4a74cf94d5ae79e9d114041cd527489600c19eb",
   "text": "我们通过脉诊（Nadi Pariksha）和望诊（Darshana Pariksha）评估dosha（体能）失衡情况，并找出您病症的根本原因。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f840fc12f5c04f40cff7",
   "sourceHash": "f840fc12f5c04f40cff769d281b095e711900407db2285efe75e39677049eba4",
   "text": "根据诊断结果，我们会制定全面的治疗计划，其中包括多种疗法的组合、草药药物、饮食建议以及生活方式调整。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e1f2e9de1ebb46488826",
   "sourceHash": "e1f2e9de1ebb464888262195a875a12b17662c00ea69bb2b49c30811238bdcdf",
   "text": "我们会根据体质类型和dosha（体能）平衡情况，提供abhyangam、dharas、podikizhi、navarakizhi、virechanam、matravasti、kashayavasti等疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Sanskrit/Malayalam therapy names kept in Latin form, as they are the only identifiers and have no established Chinese equivalents."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2502c03b7ab2e0a8103d",
   "sourceHash": "2502c03b7ab2e0a8103d9eb20060c8a6996bf1906f4cb21a6e43642eba092136",
   "text": "私人瑜伽课程：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3a010b161d7ba3264977",
   "sourceHash": "3a010b161d7ba32649770a44bb6a64e31bde9c621a1f7042c93952c9b6dc203a",
   "text": "专属的2小时个性化课程（理论+实践），内容包括体式（Asanas）、调息法（Pranayama）、排气式净化法（Pavanamukthasana Kriya）以及结合调息的火呼吸净化法（Agnisara Kriya），以增强消化、激发agni（消化之火）并恢复肠道和谐。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_620d8321cf24765c81d7",
   "sourceHash": "620d8321cf24765c81d79b61505584d7ab200864ab008d8b0e46c6edc379cd9f",
   "text": "医生会开具以天然草药制成的阿育吠陀药物，以支持身体内在的康复过程并增强体质。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d746b41b48287a377c1",
   "sourceHash": "6d746b41b48287a377c14a040b1ad2d2c0ab877771bd1acc863f01b93acb9e6b",
   "text": "饮食与生活方式指导：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f376e98e7e9dd3b65b6c",
   "sourceHash": "f376e98e7e9dd3b65b6c11b7401bcfe17b8210f78a5f76d912756faed661b6c2",
   "text": "阿育吠陀医生会根据您的dosha（体能）失衡情况提供饮食建议，并建议生活方式上的调整，以保持平衡、防止症状进一步加重。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_27b6468ce0d4ddc7d2eb",
   "sourceHash": "27b6468ce0d4ddc7d2eb861dc3d6e50c06f22d2b4f86c1817a2a99c950d672ca",
   "text": "随访与监测：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8627258ba1249e095453",
   "sourceHash": "8627258ba1249e0954532eadfa98652cd17fc5c4c918b5e07e7cee117333554c",
   "text": "我们会安排定期随访，跟踪您的进展，对治疗计划作出必要调整，并提供持续的支持与指导。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ecbcddc9a4f5ef310bb1",
   "sourceHash": "ecbcddc9a4f5ef310bb179f58c89188add93f8ebb1dd03a6c4c7baebefc35a93",
   "text": "受消化不良、腹胀或胀气困扰的人士",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
